00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,437
This is the console — a control surface, not a chat box.

2
00:00:04,387 --> 00:00:12,987
Intake is where requests are raised; Approvals is where consequential drafts wait for a human; Audit is the append-only record of everything the system did.

3
00:00:12,987 --> 00:00:21,750
The role on screen is the Energy Procurement Officer — a role card that fixes what this agent may do, in which languages, and what must be approved.

